{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09393","headline":"县斋 · 韦应物","name":"县斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲春时景好，草木渐舒荣。\n公门且无事，微雨园林清。\n决决水泉动，忻忻衆鸟鸣。\n闲斋始延瞩，东作兴庶甿。\n既事翫文墨，抱冲披道经。\n於焉日淡泊，徒使芳尊盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}